<title>USA: Henrico Cty IDA, V., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Henrico Cty IDA, V., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch  said it won $28.765 million of Henrico Cty Indudstrial Development Authority, Va., lease revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.27 percent.</p>
</text>
